<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's WestLB cuts prime rate to 22.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's WestLB cuts prime rate to 22.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Westdeutsche Landesbank (Hungaria) Rt said on Wednesday that it will reduce its prime lending rate on forint loans to 22.95 percent from 23.95 percent, effective January 27.</p>
<p>WestLB's current prime rate has been effective since November 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
